This composition looks like a maraging steel with 17 Ni, 12.3 Co, 4 Mo and 1.58 Ti, similar to C300 or C350 grades. Those grades reach roughly 1800–2400 MPa yield strength when aged. This is an estimate from the grade family, not a calculation.

The Ti content is high and Co is also high, so I estimated about 2000 MPa.

